OL,3,GNEWSAAll lanes reopen after M25 vehicle
OL,4,Afire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll lanes have reopened on a section of
OL,7,Fthe M25 in Surrey after a vehicle fire,
OL,8,Faccording to National Highways.
OL,10,FThe fire has been put out, but
OL,11,Fanticlockwise traffic between junction
OL,12,Fnine for Leatherhead and junction eight
OL,13,Ffor Reigate remains affected by the
OL,14,Fdisruption.
OL,16,FNational Highways said at 12:10 GMT
OL,17,Fthere were delays of about 24 minutes,
OL,18,Fwith tailbacks of four miles (6.4km) on
OL,19,Fthe approach to the incident.
OL,21,FVehicle recovery and clear up works
OL,22,Fwere under way, it added.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
